We provide a Zenodo archival repository with the following:

(1) the E3SMv3 code used;
(2) instructions to reproduce the runs in the manuscript;
(3) the Latin hypercube samples;
(4) instructions to retrieve the data files produced by the simulations in this
    study, which have been publicly long-term archived using NERSC HPSS;
(5) the analysis code, plotting code, emulators, and posterior chains required
    to reproduce the analyses and figures in the manuscript.

The following subfolders correspond to the items above, in order:

01_e3sm-msp2_code
02_runs
03_samples
04_archive
05_analysis
